      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.44 (vs ₹2.14 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.44 (down from ₹2.14 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹441.3m (up 30% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹9.19m (down 21% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.1% (down from 3.4% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 45% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 14% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
